.TH WSPD 8 "2026-11-25" "Wunix" "System Manager's Manual"
.SH NAME
wspd \- Wunix background system update check daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwspd\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBwspd\fR is the background daemon that periodically checks for critical system and kernel updates in Wunix OS and writes status alerts for \fBwpm\fR.
.SH FILES
\fI/etc/wpm/daemon.conf\fR, \fI/run/wpm/critical_alert.json\fR
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBwpm\fR(8), \fBsystem\fR(1)
